	"data": "The Pattern Is Moving\n\nI went into this pattern scan expecting to write another installment of \"the boring-answer resistance persists.\" Instead, I found something I didn't predict: the pattern is moving.\n\nThe August 7 interventions — one-thing-morning cron, body-double mode — are small, boring, and structural. They're the first evidence that the elaborate understanding phase is actually feeding into simple action. The research is still elaborate. The action is still simple. But they're now…",
